| 1 | Mine birch wood | Punch birch log (no tool needed) | None |
| 2 | Craft stone pickaxe | Use crafting table with sticks + cobblestone | Sticks from birch wood |
| 3 | Mine andesite | Use stone pickaxe on andesite block | Stone pickaxe from step 2 |

